Function \f(CW\*(C`fish/fish.c:decode_ps1\*(C'\fR
.IX Subsection "Function fish/fish.c:decode_ps1"
.PP
.Vb 2
\& static char *
\& decode_ps1 (const char *str)
.Ve
.PP
Decode \f(CW\*(C`str\*(C'\fR into the final printable prompt string.
